  "description": "The Wattle Grove Motel is conveniently located on Welshpool Road East - nestled between the Roe and Tonkin Highway. We are very close to the airport and offer 3 and a half star accommodation. All rooms are situated on the ground floor with parking directly outside your door. If you have additional vehicles, we have a large car park that can house your trailer or large 4WD. All rooms have Foxtel, reverse cycle air conditioning, kitchenette with microwave. The Grove Grill is our fully licensed restaurant and offers dinner 7 nights per week from 530pm and we also provide room service if you'd prefer to eat in. Rooms are serviced daily and we are situated on 5 acres amongst tall trees and extensive gardens.",
